section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><strong><span>1.师生互选：</span></strong></span><span><span>研究所发展战略、导师研究方向和同学兴趣专长相结合。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>2.精心指导：</span></strong></span><span><span>导师、课题组负责和团队指导相结合。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>3.助优推优：</span></strong></span><span><span>为优秀学生量身定制配备优质指导团队对学生进行全方位提升。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>4.大师指导：</span></strong></span><span><span>提供国内外院士、资深导师的个别指导与教诲。</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/feZj6icaiagsswicK5zbyhubyBF9aicwBIynZ0ibP5vBWUeicnEzHFlqFAlFibZxWv9o4hmpHyj6kHicUCeJ4pgo9b8Jyw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>施剑林院士指导研究生</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/feZj6icaiagsswicK5zbyhubyBF9aicwBIynHRiaibZzKpGBu8BxU8QtzUib1OYepNHLksiaebcuCicKqkOsW45jNtB9gkw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>董绍明院士指导研究生</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/feZj6icaiagsswicK5zbyhubyBF9aicwBIynaKbIgq0rNfNJqxv7WlezkO1l6YGlYA2KxqpCYsSD0GCc9EoN8Kg1gQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>陈立东院士指导研究生</span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/9mQ59rPCgSv6Nw6pwVcCdvxxBMNZP1w2wH3pzF0eCNvibKZfctusx6QKpEvrGn3Mjrt7EmwHxQHF7WIib1YcKC9A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>浓厚的学术氛围</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/9mQ59rPCgSv6Nw6pwVcCdvxxBMNZP1w2wH3pzF0eCNvibKZfctusx6QKpEvrGn3Mjrt7EmwHxQHF7WIib1YcKC9A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>现有</span><span><strong><span>“东生讲坛”、“研究生学术论坛”、“研究生英语学术交流报告会”</span></strong></span><span>、等各类论坛和报告会。</span></p><p><span>积极组织开展各类提升创新能力讲座，提高研究生创新能力和英文科技论文写作能力等。</span></p><p><span>设立</span><span><strong><span>研究生科技创新成果培育计划</span></strong></span><span>，资助研究生赴国外参加国际学术会议，增长科研视野。</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>组织研究生以做口头报告、墙报等形式参加各类国际，国内学术论坛。研究生频获各类学术论坛优秀口头报告、优秀墙报奖。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/feZj6icaiagsswicK5zbyhubyBF9aicwBIynkdG8maWm1nJwMc7mojRHSYqdYiaL41OicgFmqlgDeER1zV1mkhouYoTA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>2021级研究生姚凌波参加2024年全国绿碳科学会议并获研究生论坛优秀口头报告一等奖</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/feZj6icaiagsswicK5zbyhubyBF9aicwBIynffYteliczl2NE2KCXN2D13d7Sa0SddQPe1eSJnytHegWmy8Nd5IL6Rw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><font><span><span>研究生学术报告风采</span></span></font></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/feZj6icaiagsswicK5zbyhubyBF9aicwBIyncic1CTXLciazcIo4UpK1xXn2oY7OHgE9joErZ21ibbSRpz9BFbsVTdiaLQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>2024年上海硅酸盐所举办国科大研究生论坛</span></p><p><span>材料分论坛</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/9mQ59rPCgSv6Nw6pwVcCdvxxBMNZP1w2wH3pzF0eCNvibKZfctusx6QKpEvrGn3Mjrt7EmwHxQHF7WIib1YcKC9A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>广阔的国际视野</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"