r/></span></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/feZj6icaiagsswicK5zbyhubyBF9aicwBIyn4icRhOyibFyxQiabYAQYIvrn417d8ov9QTDcHSv2VH7umia5Pia0quKTfBw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/feZj6icaiagsswicK5zbyhubyBF9aicwBIynvzDBaWDTPdYriaL7LnJAsLqlmxZDg3xLvibTsY7btPUKAicR3QCTIZ5nA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>举办丰富多样的访企拓岗活动拓宽研究生就业渠道</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/feZj6icaiagsswicK5zbyhubyBF9aicwBIynJ6D0VuMicYThOVy9rBJDMgahWMqeiabGSqOtOKsdqVdjFSicOpSPGjiaAg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/9mQ59rPCgSv6Nw6pwVcCdvxxBMNZP1w2ibtKZThnH6Y4MSMMpbeyZnJRVWAiczd90cc5o4gNUIGXtkRk6mgWic2uw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>2025夏令营</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/9mQ59rPCgSv6Nw6pwVcCdvxxBMNZP1w2ibtKZThnH6Y4MSMMpbeyZnJRVWAiczd90cc5o4gNUIGXtkRk6mgWic2uw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/feZj6icaiagsswicK5zbyhubyBF9aicwBIynFhZcib8RBokJNt6CZVr0mftRN9JwyoVcIv4mxwB2KNj53GINHVpHPbg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/feZj6icaiagsswicK5zbyhubyBF9aicwBIynLVKB9ws9LKW425kB6ErMBMClNWsFRbb3zeXwnmIo0d2LXjZibaqRrAg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/feZj6icaiagsswicK5zbyhubyBF9aicwBIyna1Zepne683PUhVR3e2euABJl61z5YXib9eb4iaycCdxmVOPa4Ie5njLg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>中国科学院上海硅酸盐研究所2025年“下一站，硅所”大学生夏令营拟采取线上线下相结合的方式进行，届时将安排学生参观本所、聆听各研究中心介绍、参加专家学术报告、参观实验室、与研究生师兄师姐和导师交流、推荐免试面试等活动。此次夏令营面向全国双一流高校优秀本科生，接收500名左右学员。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1.申请条件</span></p><p><span>（1）材料、物理、化学、生物、电子信息及相关专业大学三年级学生（2026年7月毕业）；</span></p><p><span>（2）学习成绩优秀,预估可获得本校推免资格；</span></p><p><span>（3）对材料、物理、化学、生物、电子信息等领域有浓厚兴趣，并有较强的或潜在的研究能力。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.申请办法及时间</span></p><p><span>请扫描下方二维码填报信息并提交。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/feZj6icaiagsswicK5zbyhubyBF9aicwBIynsUEhEk1m7V3gCKeJoHibq2fVyyUGnbWpG01IKIkLZib9HtTNDXGjr9PA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>申请时间：即日起至</span><span><strong><span>2025年6月20日</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>    拟于2025年6月25日左右在所网站公布2024年夏令营入围名单，并会通过电子邮件直接通知本人。</span></p><p><span>    届时未接到录取通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。线上大学生夏令营拟定于2025年7月7日-11日举行，线下夏令营具体安排另行通知。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" refer